                - I kind of like the idea of the profile having two sections: one being long-term information, the other being stuff we can uncover during the current scene.
                    So Barbara has three locked pieces of information in the current section, each with a keyword. We're not told the order the keywords will appear in. We proceed through
                    the convo and look for the keywords, reading her mind when they crop up. Each unlocks a piece of information for the current scene. Once all of them have been unlocked,
